    },
    {
      "n": 13,
      "text": "부산역 물품보관함 위치",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 14,
      "text": "​\n\n​\n\n기차에서 내려 \n\n에스컬레이터를 타고 \n\n대합실로 들어서면 \n\n생각보다 역사가 넓어서 \n\n눈동자가 핑글핑글 돌기 십상이죠! \n\n​\n\n​\n\n​",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 15,
      "text": "",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjA2MDlfNjcg/MDAxNzgxMDA5NTg4NDAz.in7X6m37RZwEi4N7fgbG3P8NUQ40vhBVOH9hTauS4NUg.MVG7_VnZKkLlXfhZeFyVGPqxOnhL5s3kcLcK3jDSDj0g.JPEG/SE-399be1e8-df0e-456d-9239-8d53f4c53794.jpg?type=w80_blur",
          "full": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjA2MDlfNjcg/MDAxNzgxMDA5NTg4NDAz.in7X6m37RZwEi4N7fgbG3P8NUQ40vhBVOH9hTauS4NUg.MVG7_VnZKkLlXfhZeFyVGPqxOnhL5s3kcLcK3jDSDj0g.JPEG/SE-399be1e8-df0e-456d-9239-8d53f4c53794.jpg?type=w80_blur"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 16,
      "text": "​\n\n​\n\n기차역사 내 물품보관함은\n\n1층과 2층, 총 2곳에 있어요.\n\n​\n\n​",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 17,
      "text": "층\n\n\t\n\n상세 위치\n\n\n\n\n2층\n\n\t\n\n철도경찰센터 방향의 남천할매떡볶이 뒤\n\n\n\n\n1층\n\n\t\n\n5번 출구 쪽 인근",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 18,
      "text": "​\n\n​",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 19,
      "text": "",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjA2MDlfMjI1/MDAxNzgxMDA5ODk4ODc5.teAriGomWBRIXoi4ZjaCnbY1XBLYCjV0sBM0fkfPJvYg.GOusjohCXPjbgY_oZ3nsyZcHapMzU63WOdZTxwn4rG0g.JPEG/IMG_7761.jpg?type=w80_blur",
          "full": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjA2MDlfMjI1/MDAxNzgxMDA5ODk4ODc5.teAriGomWBRIXoi4ZjaCnbY1XBLYCjV0sBM0fkfPJvYg.GOusjohCXPjbgY_oZ3nsyZcHapMzU63WOdZTxwn4rG0g.JPEG/IMG_7761.jpg?type=w80_blur"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 20,
      "text": "​\n\n​\n\n​\n\n역사 내 표지물로\n\n위치를 잘 안내해주고 있으니\n\n길이 헷갈릴 땐 \n\n머리 위 화살표를 적극 활용해보세요!\n\n​\n\n​\n\n​",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 21,
      "text": "",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjA2MDlfNTMg/MDAxNzgxMDEwNDUxMjI4._EyGpG6yAwUJMEYwLTk-ja-y3t8ON4HfaeCVEHDw4KIg.zas3QSxut2385LGN3By0Zi76U6yFP8dFtvxaMqIT3m8g.PNG/SE-3c023c11-178b-4980-9d8f-751639624d46.png?type=w80_blur",
          "full": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjA2MDlfNTMg/MDAxNzgxMDEwNDUxMjI4._EyGpG6yAwUJMEYwLTk-ja-y3t8ON4HfaeCVEHDw4KIg.zas3QSxut2385LGN3By0Zi76U6yFP8dFtvxaMqIT3m8g.PNG/SE-3c023c11-178b-4980-9d8f-751639624d46.png?type=w80_blur"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 22,
      "text": "​\n\n​\n\n​\n\n가는 길 곳곳에 있는 기둥에도 \n\n물품보관함을 안내해주는\n\n화살표가 커다랗게 붙어 있어요!\n\n​\n\n​\n\n​\n\n​",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 23,
      "text": "",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjA2MDlfMTQ0/MDAxNzgxMDEwMDU5MzAz.aJriXjzKozFAmtv2CPYDo_JP71nGiX0J1mNJE5lub9Eg.Df58z3kfMWXvX0i3x1oR-SPmvMHdjRer8wexm-XzMwIg.JPEG/SE-97079b29-2f7b-4235-b4f1-ac124262dcef.jpg?type=w80_blur",
          "full": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjA2MDlfMTQ0/MDAxNzgxMDEwMDU5MzAz.aJriXjzKozFAmtv2CPYDo_JP71nGiX0J1mNJE5lub9Eg.Df58z3kfMWXvX0i3x1oR-SPmvMHdjRer8wexm-XzMwIg.JPEG/SE-97079b29-2f7b-4235-b4f1-ac124262dcef.jpg?type=w80_blur"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 24,
      "text": "​\n\n​\n\n마침내 대문짝하게 붙어 있는\n\n물품보관함 글자를 발견하셨다면\n\n부산역 물품보관소 찾기 성공! 후후.\n\n​\n\n​",
      "images": []
    },
